        <mxCell id="st" value="&lt;b&gt;Streamlit in Snowflake&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;#8220;Is it alive?&amp;#8221; dashboard&lt;br&gt;new quakes per run,&lt;br&gt;today vs 5-year average" vertex="1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=13;spacing=8;strokeWidth=1.5;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;">
          <mxGeometry x="1160" y="140" width="180" height="120" as="geometry" />
